# LSan suppression file for xreader's unit tests.
#
# These allocations are static caches owned by third-party
# libraries (fontconfig, pango, cairo, expat) that are only
# reclaimed when the library's process-exit cleanup runs.
# GTest binaries that create & destroy GTK widgets do not reach
# that cleanup before LeakSanitizer scans the heap, so we
# suppress those known-good leaks -- WITHOUT suppressing the
# project's own memory management, which stays strictly checked.
#
# Usage: LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=$PWD/tools/lsan.supp ./tests
leak:libfontconfig.so
leak:FcFontRenderPrepare
leak:FcFontSetMatch
leak:FcValueSave
leak:FcConfigSubstituteWithPat
leak:libpangoft2
leak:libpango-1.0.so
leak:libexpat.so
leak:libcairo.so
leak:ft_loop
leak:g_private_get
leak:g_thread
leak:pango_font_map